:: Street killer - lone killer [Place bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">STREETS</h1>
<br />
<center>
    <<image 'places/underground/street_killer_lone.jpg'>>
</center>
<br /><br />
The tip led you to a storage room behind the old market — the kind of place people use when they don't want to be found.
<br /><br />
He was alone. Drunk, still wearing the same jacket from last night. He looked up when you stepped through the door and didn't even try to run.
<br /><br />
<<newguy>>
<<set $tmpGuy.name = either('Cain', 'Voss', 'Rex', 'Decker', 'Harlan', 'Pike', 'Slade', 'Murt', 'Breck')>>
<<set $tmpGuy.strength = randomInteger(15, 35)>>
<<set $tmpGuy.loyal = false>>
<<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
    You got nothing on me. She was just a whore.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
He said it like it was supposed to end the conversation.
<br /><br />
<div id="sk_kill_block">
<<linkreplace 'Kill him'>>
    <<set _skKillerName = $tmpGuy.name>>
    <<unset $tmpGuy>>
    <<unset $game.streetsKilledNpc>>
    <<run $('#sk_enslave_block').hide()>>
    He barely got another word out. You made it quick — as quick as he'd made it for <<=($game.streetsKilledNpc?.name ?? 'her')>>.
    <br /><br />
    <<=_skKillerName>> wouldn't be doing this to anyone else.
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Leave'>>
        <<goto 'Underground city'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="sk_enslave_block">
<<linkreplace 'Take him'>>
    <<run setup.npc.addHistory($tmpGuy, 'enslaved', { reason: 'street_murder' })>>
    <<run $slaves.push($tmpGuy)>>
    <<unset $tmpGuy>>
    <<unset $game.streetsKilledNpc>>
    <<run $('#sk_kill_block').hide()>>
    You dragged him out by the collar. He started talking then — explaining, justifying — but you weren't listening.
    <br /><br />
    The kind of man who only goes after people who can't fight back tends to go very quiet once someone finally does.
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Head home'>>
        <<goto 'Underground city'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
